{"id":"royaume","lemma":"royaume","pos":"noun","rank":1773,"glosses":["kingdom"],"ipa":"/ʁwa.jom/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f3/Fr-royaume.ogg/Fr-royaume.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"royaumes"},"formAudio":{"royaumes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-royaumes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il fut banni du royaume.","en":"He was banished from the kingdom.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"to banish","l":"bannir"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Il gouverna équitablement son royaume.","en":"He ruled his kingdom fairly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"fairly"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"À la mort du roi, le royaume fut plongé dans le chaos.","en":"When the king died, the kingdom was thrown into chaos.","words":[null,null,{"g":"dead"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"to dive","l":"plonger"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"chaos"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"a la"]]},{"text":"RU est l'abréviation de Royaume-Uni.","en":"UK is the abbreviation for the United Kingdom.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"abbreviation"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to unite, join","l":"unir"}]},{"text":"Londres est la capitale du Royaume-Uni.","en":"London is the capital of the United Kingdom.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"capital, capital city"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"to unite, join","l":"unir"}]}]}